portfolio-site/
├── index.html
├── css/
│   ├── style.css
│   └── responsive.css
├── js/
│   └── main.js
├── images/
│   ├── profile.jpg
│   └── projects/
├── assets/
│   ├── resume.pdf
│   └── icons/
├── pages/
│   ├── about.html
│   ├── projects.html
│   └── contact.html
└── README.md
```

**File Structure Overview:**
- `index.html` - Main landing page
- `css/` - Stylesheets for design and responsiveness
- `js/` - JavaScript for interactivity
- `images/` - Profile photos and project screenshots
- `assets/` - Resume, icons, and other resources
- `pages/` - Additional HTML pages
- `README.md` - Project documentation
